{{Documentation/Header}}
A live countdown timer to a scheduled date and time. The template renders a container with <code>data-</code> attributes; the visible ticking numbers are produced by the wiki's countdown JavaScript, so nothing appears if scripts are disabled.

==Syntax==
{{T|Countdown|block=1
|v1=endTime =
|v2=timezone =
|v3=title =
|v4=style =
|v5=align =
}}

==Example==
{{T|Countdown
|endTime = 2029-05-05 15:37:25
|timezone = UTC+9
|title = Season 3 Launch!
|style = card
|align = center
|_Y_=1
}}

{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Parameter !! Aliases !! Label !! Description !! Type !! Default !! Status
|-
| <code>endTime</code> || – || End time || Target date and time, as <code>YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS</code>. || string || – || <span style="color:red;font-weight:bold;">Required</span>
|-
| <code>timezone</code> || – || Timezone || Timezone the end time is expressed in. || string || UTC+9 ||
|-
| <code>title</code> || – || Title || Caption shown above the timer. Omitted renders no title. || string || – ||
|-
| <code>style</code> || – || Style || Visual variant, applied as the CSS class <code>countdown-style-…</code>. || string || card ||
|-
| <code>align</code> || – || Alignment || Applied as the CSS class <code>countdown-align-…</code>. || string || left ||
|}

